219 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/ActualText(The break of structure is a concept that focuses on identifying shifts in the market\220s overall trend. A break of structure is said to have taken place when the price sets a new high or a new low while breaking the former ones.)/K[6]/Pg 50 0 R/S/P>>
endobj

